  "interpretation_ceiling": "Counts of GRANTED building licences whose official callejero address point lies inside a planning ámbito with a PUBLISHED state in the stated edition. This is administrative co-location, not evidence that works started, were executed or finished. The point is an address, not the parcel of the action. The edition state is a single dated snapshot and is never read as the state at the grant date of any licence. An ámbito without an entry has no building licence of this register with a point inside it; that says nothing about other urban activity. No rate, ranking, dwelling count, progress or cross-family total is derived."
